{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/2+2=4.png?t=1749311772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>math is hard</strong>\u00a0makes you put to the test your math skills and logical thinking, pushing blocks around the grid solving puzzles. Simple addition and subtraction won't always do the trick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/levels.png?t=1749311772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has planned over 50 levels. Going through locked doors or sliding on ice and using different combinations of operations (+, \u2013, \u00d7, \u00f7) you must reach the target value. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/wishlist.png?t=1749311772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>math is hard</strong> challenges both your head for numbers and your eye for strategy. Ready to prove that, with the right moves, math really isn\u2019t so hard after all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was originally created for and won the MiniJam 183: Calculations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739920?t=1749311772","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739920?t=1749311772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/b8144dd8b60017d2af4633741dc2262d8393d75a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749311772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/